  "id": 8860127658183,
  "title": "Custom Purple Floral Cross with Butterflies Blanket, Machi - Design 14",
  "handle": "custom-purple-floral-cross-with-butterflies-blanket-machi-design-14",
  "body_html": "<p>Surround yourself or a loved one in faith and comfort with this personalized Christian blanket from Jeminise. Crafted from skin-friendly fabric and adorned with uplifting Bible verses, this blanket is a meaningful keepsake for believers and a source of daily encouragement.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> An inspirational religious throw blanket featuring uplifting Bible verses, perfect for various occasions.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Add a name or date to create a unique and heartfelt Jesus Christ blanket.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Made from soft, skin-friendly fabric for warmth, peace, and comfort during prayer or quiet time.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from 30x40, 50x60, or 60x80 inches to suit your needs.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; air dry without heat. Microfiber dries quickly and fluffs up nicely.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Ideal for indoor use, providing comfort and inspiration throughout all seasons.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Cotton/ Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>D14</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Christmas, Religious</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>butterflies, floral, cloud, cross</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Blanket Form</th>\n<td>Throw Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>30x40, 50x60, 60x80 inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>40\"L x 30\"W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Customizable, Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
